// Shared vectors: Fixtures/transport-v2.json is a verbatim copy of
// TodeX_protocol/tests/fixtures/transport-v2.json (generated by its
// scripts/generate-transport-v2-vectors.cjs). Re-copy it whenever the
// generator changes; `vectorFileMatchesProtocolCheckout` flags drift when the
